{% comment %}
  ============================================================
  THE CREATIVE PLATTER — Material & Craft Manifesto
  ============================================================
  Pushpa Brochure Integration:
  - "NOTHING IS CUT AWAY. NOTHING IS DISCARDED. THE FORM FOLLOWS THE MATERIAL."
  - Recycled clay, mould-free shaping, 24k gold, 1280°C firing,
    and Gurugram village women artisan impact.
  Copy into Shopify: sections/section-home-material-craft.liquid
{% endcomment %}

<style>
  .tcp-craft {
    background-color: var(--tcp-brown, #352922);
    color: var(--tcp-sand, #FBF9F5);
    padding: 100px 0;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .tcp-craft__inner {
    max-width: 1440px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 40px;
  }

  .tcp-craft__manifesto {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 860px;
    margin: 0 auto 64px;
  }

  .tcp-craft__manifesto-label {
    font-family: var(--font-sans, sans-serif);
    font-size: 10.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--tcp-gold-light, #DFBA5E);
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .tcp-craft__manifesto-quote {
    font-family: var(--font-serif, serif);
    font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 48px);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.2;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }

  .tcp-craft__manifesto-divider {
    width: 60px;
    height: 1.5px;
    background: var(--tcp-gold, #C29B38);
    margin: 0 auto 24px;
  }

  .tcp-craft__manifesto-text {
    font-family: var(--font-sans, sans-serif);
    font-size: 15px;
    color: rgba(251, 249, 245, 0.8);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  /* ── 4 Pillars Grid ── */
  .tcp-craft__pillars {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 32px;
    margin-top: 48px;
  }

  .tcp-craft-pillar {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 36px 28px;
    transition: all 0.4s var(--ease-fluid);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .tcp-craft-pillar:hover {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    border-color: var(--tcp-gold, #C29B38);
    transform: translateY(-4px);
  }

  .tcp-craft-pillar__num {
    font-family: var(--font-serif, serif);
    font-size: 28px;
    color: var(--tcp-gold-light, #DFBA5E);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .tcp-craft-pillar__title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif, serif);
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    margin: 0 0 10px;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .tcp-craft-pillar__desc {
    font-family: var(--font-sans, sans-serif);
    font-size: 13px;
    color: rgba(251, 249, 245, 0.75);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* ── Bottom Impact Banner ── */
  .tcp-craft__impact-banner {
    margin-top: 64px;
    background: rgba(194, 155, 56, 0.12);
    border: 1px solid var(--tcp-gold, #C29B38);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 32px 40px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 32px;
  }

  .tcp-craft__impact-left h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif, serif);
    font-size: 24px;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    margin: 0 0 6px;
  }

  .tcp-craft__impact-left p {
    font-family: var(--font-sans, sans-serif);
    font-size: 13.5px;
    color: rgba(251, 249, 245, 0.85);
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .tcp-craft__impact-btn {
    font-family: var(--font-sans, sans-serif);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--tcp-dark, #1F1D1B);
    background: var(--tcp-gold, #C29B38);
    padding: 14px 28px;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-radius: 2px;
    white-space: nowrap;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .tcp-craft__impact-btn:hover {
    background: #FFFFFF;
  }

  /* ── Responsive ── */
  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .tcp-craft__pillars {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
    .tcp-craft__impact-banner {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .tcp-craft {
      padding: 60px 0;
    }
    .tcp-craft__inner {
      padding: 0 20px;
    }
    .tcp-craft__pillars {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 16px;
    }
    .tcp-craft__impact-banner {
      padding: 24px;
    }
  }
</style>

<section class="tcp-craft" id="tcp-material-craft">
  <div class="tcp-craft__inner">
    <!-- Manifesto Header -->
    <div class="tcp-craft__manifesto">
      <span class="tcp-craft__manifesto-label">THE CRAFT PRINCIPLE</span>
      <h2 class="tcp-craft__manifesto-quote">
        &ldquo;NOTHING IS CUT AWAY. NOTHING IS DISCARDED. THE FORM FOLLOWS THE MATERIAL.&rdquo;
      </h2>
      <div class="tcp-craft__manifesto-divider"></div>
      <p class="tcp-craft__manifesto-text">
        Smriti explores how memory can be translated into objects that become part of everyday rituals. The collection deliberately embraces the raw and organic character of clay, rather than pursuing industrial uniformity. Each object retains subtle variations in form, contour, texture, and edge.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 4 Craft Pillars -->
    <div class="tcp-craft__pillars">
      <div class="tcp-craft-pillar">
        <span class="tcp-craft-pillar__num">01</span>
        <h3 class="tcp-craft-pillar__title">Recycled Ceramic Clay</h3>
        <p class="tcp-craft-pillar__desc">
          Zero material off-cuts. Clay is reworked and returned into the making cycle, allowing the natural organic edges to dictate the form.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="tcp-craft-pillar">
        <span class="tcp-craft-pillar__num">02</span>
        <h3 class="tcp-craft-pillar__title">Mould-Free Hand Craft</h3>
        <p class="tcp-craft-pillar__desc">
          Created through hand-led pinching and slab techniques where the artisan works directly with the clay rather than reproducing a rigid mould.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="tcp-craft-pillar">
        <span class="tcp-craft-pillar__num">03</span>
        <h3 class="tcp-craft-pillar__title">1280°C Stoneware</h3>
        <p class="tcp-craft-pillar__desc">
          High-fired for supreme durability. Non-toxic, 100% food-safe, microwave, oven, and commercial dishwasher safe for home &amp; hospitality.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="tcp-craft-pillar">
        <span class="tcp-craft-pillar__num">04</span>
        <h3 class="tcp-craft-pillar__title">24k Gold Kintsugi Lip</h3>
        <p class="tcp-craft-pillar__desc">
          Finished with subtle hand-painted gold leaf highlights on raw contours, honoring memory and the beauty of human imperfection.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Social Impact Banner -->
    <div class="tcp-craft__impact-banner">
      <div class="tcp-craft__impact-left">
        <h3>Social Impact &bull; Village Women Artisans</h3>
        <p>
          Our studio near Gurugram creates skill-based livelihoods for village craftswomen, bridging ancient handcraft with contemporary living.
        </p>
      </div>
      <a href="/pages/story#impact" class="tcp-craft__impact-btn">Read Our Impact Story &rarr;</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "TCP Material & Craft",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "tcp-craft-section",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "TCP Material & Craft"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
